  (text "Test points and safety sequence" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "3438e960-b1a8-596f-b3df-48a19f3e03e3"))
  (text "Safety sequence / required bench checks" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "3e67ceb1-6e7d-5470-a563-db0ce593b610"))
  (text "1. USB supplies all 5V logic. External supply is regulated, current-limited and shares GND.\n2. Power-up / RESET / ISP / DTR reset: CE and OE HIGH, relay READ, VPP disabled.\n3. Preflight VPP measurement is made with relay in READ; onboard socket is isolated from VPP.\n4. Verify target VCC before enabling VPP. Verify VPP voltage before every programming pulse.\n5. Remove VPP and confirm VPP_SW <0.40V before verifying or releasing PROG_MODE.\n6. Watchdog / timeout / invalid command returns to safe mode.\n7. NEVER insert/remove an EPROM with USB or VPP connected. One populated target only.\n8. Before commissioning WRITE, scope pin 22 for overshoot (<14V) and rise time (<=50ns).\n9. This revision is a schematic/prototype basis; ERC cannot certify switching waveforms or PCB layout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 229 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "c3dbfe7f-cf7d-56ab-95a4-23b30fca0768"))
